# Pre-push verification (oxplayer-client) — required

Every `git push` must pass `scripts/verify-all.sh` (enforced by the pre-push hook).

**One-time setup after clone:**

```bash
bash scripts/install-pre-push-hook.sh
```

**Manual run (same check the hook uses):**

```bash
bash scripts/verify-all.sh
```

Hook source (versioned): `scripts/git-hooks/pre-push`. Do not bypass with `--no-verify` unless explicitly debugging hook issues.

Playback and catalog UI hooks for OX belong in `lib/oxplayer/` with thin call sites in Fladder detail/playback files — do not rewrite upstream providers.

After server API fixes, confirm on a movie/episode with **2+ file variants**:
- Version picker appears next to Play
- Labels show quality/language (from `MediaSource.Name`)
- Playback starts for each selected variant
